              "text": "tugurium, tuguriī — \"a hut, a shed\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Pauper agricola in tuguriō cum familiā vīvit. The poor farmer lives in a hut with his family."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Second declension, neuter: tugurium, tuguriī n. A rough hut, poorer than a casa."
            }
          ]
        },
